    "notes": [
      "Chapter-specific castle, cake and dark-fortress paintings are unavailable; each left art slot uses the new gold-chest illustration as an explicit generic pack proxy.",
      "First two full chapter rows and the partially visible third row are represented. Third-row price is offscreen and is not invented.",
      "Chapter rewards are native quantity strings in the observed order: gem / gold ticket / gold coin / question-card. Exact original tiny reward icon drawings are omitted.",
      "Header currency values are native text; exact source currency pictograms are omitted here, and no new currency balances are inferred.",
      "Shop footer keeps independent native text captions inside each of the four destination buttons at 14px. The back chevron is also a separate native caption because deleting the old combined string would otherwise remove it. Original nav pictograms remain omitted.",
      "텍스트 분리를 우선한 v003은 앞선 35행 가이드를 넘을 수 있습니다. 개별 글자가 해당 버튼 부모 안에 있으므로 단일 공백 문자열로 배치하지 않습니다.",
      "v004 artwork-only patch: Chapter1Art → chest, Chapter2Art → chest, Chapter3Art → chest. Uses the newly drawn six-cell shop atlas; source item identity and exact original shape are not claimed. Text, quantities, duration, positions, parents, inputs and button behavior are unchanged.",
      "v007 shop-family footer: group420×82 at(0,842), observed Back input40×82 at x0, four destination tabs95×82 at x40/135/230/325. Separate native captions91×38,14px remain within their own tabs. This is not the global five84px-cell navigation specification; no fifth shop destination or relocated Back was invented.",
      "v007 Difficulty Normal/Elite use equal64×58 input rectangles so native labels at y258..279 remain inside their corresponding button. The source label-under-icon structure is preserved; no unobserved Elite destination is added.",
      "v007 native tab/filter/advance captions are children of their corresponding button, preserving two-part copy/reuse and the correct button input/state ownership."
    ],
